{"agent":"impl-ra-sites4","data":{"fix_task":"fix-B31f83a9d7b","item":"RA-consume-sites-4","repro":{"bytes":6639,"mode":"full","ref":"sha256:e989dd9ca432eb7fad33e68ff178be311fd13b28e2784190a7cab07427f5aed7","truncated":false},"scope":"ddflow","severity":"medium","summary":"A gated verb named [REDACTED:host] was written to ask.requested as [REDACTED:host] (host-name redaction takes a word ending .local for a machine name), so the stored verb never equals the canon verb and every approval of it is refused as 'an approval for [REDACTED:host]'. The verb field is declared verbatim in LOG_VERBATIM_FIELDS yet is still redacted. Repro: ddflow export enable changelog --local with --agent bot under a site named [REDACTED:host], then read asks_of(state)[id]['verb']. Worked around by naming the site export.machine.","title":"An approval verb ending in .local is stored as [REDACTED:host]"},"id":"eb47a1631ae494a2a83972535","kind":"bug.found","lamport":117008,"schema":1,"subject":"B31f83a9d7b","ts":"2026-10-31T07:06:54.338135Z"}
{"agent":"impl-ra-sites4","data":{"body":"Fixes bug B31f83a9d7b: A gated verb named [REDACTED:host] was written to ask.requested as [REDACTED:host] (host-name redaction takes a word ending .local for a machine name), so the stored verb never equals the canon verb and every approval of it is refused as 'an approval for [REDACTED:host]'. The verb field is declared verbatim in LOG_VERBATIM_FIELDS yet is still redacted. Repro: ddflow export enable changelog --local with --agent bot under a site named [REDACTED:host], then read asks_of(state)[id]['verb']. Worked around by naming the site export.machine. Found on RA-consume-sites-4.\n\nWrite the regression test first and watch it FAIL on the unfixed code; then `ddflow complete fix-B31f83a9d7b --regression-test <test>` closes the bug with the task (or `ddflow bug fixed B31f83a9d7b --regression-test <test>` first).","fixes":["B31f83a9d7b"],"globs":[],"line":"","needs":[],"parent":"bugs-2","priority":10,"tags":["bugfix"],"title":"Fix bug B31f83a9d7b: An approval verb ending in .local is stored as [REDACTED:host]"},"id":"ebe931bd1dc945697cfc3aaaf","kind":"task.added","lamport":117009,"schema":1,"subject":"fix-B31f83a9d7b","ts":"2026-10-31T07:06:54.386372Z"}
